    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30627" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχρῴζομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be
			engrained</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἅπασι τοῖς μέρεσιν ἐγκέχρωσται ἡ
					λευκότης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Xen.</u>
					978a11
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>to be amalgamated with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάθος ἐγκεχρωσμένον τῷ βίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>EN</u>
					1105a3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμον ἐν τοῖς ἤθεσι καὶ τοῖς
					ἐπιταδεύμασι τῶν πολιτᾶν ἐγχρῴζεσθαι δεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archyt.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.1.138
			</span></i>:—
				Act.
			 only <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχρώσας: χρίσας</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
